{"title": "The engulfing candle", "type": "Technical lesson", "hooks": ["Stop ignoring the candle that swallows the last one whole.", "One candle that swallows the last one whole. Here's what it means.", "One candle can flip control from buyers to sellers."], "scenes": [{"kind": "hook", "vo": "Stop ignoring the candle that swallows the last one whole.", "text": "One candle swallows another", "chart": 0, "win": [20, 102], "show": 90}, {"kind": "chart", "chart": 0, "head": "Bullish engulfing", "show": 51, "vo": "A small red candle, then a big green one whose body covers it completely. That's a bullish engulfing. Buyers have taken over.", "cues": [{"say": "a big green one", "do": "reveal", "to": 52}, {"say": "bullish engulfing", "do": "mark", "i": 52, "label": "B", "side": "low", "tone": "green"}], "win": [20, 102]}, {"kind": "chart", "chart": 0, "head": "Bearish engulfing", "show": 89, "vo": "Flip it. A green candle, then a bigger red one covering its body. Bearish engulfing. Sellers have taken over.", "cues": [{"say": "a bigger red one", "do": "reveal", "to": 90}, {"say": "Bearish engulfing", "do": "mark", "i": 90, "label": "S", "side": "high", "tone": "red"}], "win": [20, 102]}, {"kind": "chart", "chart": 0, "head": "Ten candles later", "show": 90, "vo": "Ten candles later, Lumen Therapeutics was 1.6 percent lower. A clue, not a guarantee.", "cues": [{"say": "Ten candles later", "do": "reveal", "to": 100}], "win": [20, 102]}, {"kind": "big", "text": "After a long move, on volume", "vo": "They mean most after a long move, at a level that matters, and on heavy volume. On their own, they predict little.", "chart": null}, {"kind": "outro", "text": "Spot them yourself", "vo": "Practise spotting engulfing candles on real game charts at memestreet.net.", "chart": null}], "caption": "Stop ignoring the candle that swallows the last one whole.\n\nA small red candle, then a big green one that covers it: bullish engulfing, buyers took over. Flip it, and it's bearish engulfing.\